{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}{{ T.nav_about }} · {{ T.site_name }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<article class="prose">
<h1>{{ T.nav_about }}</h1>
<p class="lead">Paleo Atlas is a paleontology encyclopedia that rebuilds itself every day from open scientific data.</p>
<p>Every morning it checks Wikipedia, the Paleobiology Database and Crossref for news; when there are any, it updates the data, writes and checks the new pages and republishes the site. The whole process is open and auditable on <a href="https://github.com/AdayCuestaCorrea/paleo-atlas">GitHub</a>.</p>
<p>It is a personal project by Aday Cuesta Correa, built at zero cost with open tools.</p>
</article>
{% endblock %}
